;
; Cycle-accurate step delay for the POV scanner.
;
; Matrix GPIOs are not a contiguous bank, so this SM does not drive pins.
; Core 1 applies each uint32_t mask with gpio_put_masked, then pushes a delay
; (in PIO cycles at clkdiv=1 ≈ sysclk) into this FIFO. DMA can refill the FIFO
; with equal delays for a whole revolution while core 1 walks the mask list.

.program step_delay
.wrap_target
    pull block
    out x, 32
delay:
    jmp x-- delay
.wrap
